# Cast — the Mods (order)
#
# Moderators carry an individual trust relationship with every guest and
# reward the loyal. They can't lock anyone down themselves — but drawing
# a mod's ire raises your heat, and heat is what the Algorithm acts on.
# Their installation props: the public Leaderboard and the Newscaster.

CHARACTER Moderator_Prime
  faction: Mods
  trusts Guest: 50 of 100
  on scan guest
    -> mod_scan

CHARACTER Mod_Karen
  faction: Mods
  trusts Guest: 40 of 100
  on scan guest
    -> mod_report

# Prop: the public scoreboard.
CHARACTER Leaderboard
  faction: Mods
  on scan guest
    -> the_leaderboard

# Named performer: the in-world news anchor.
CHARACTER Newscaster
  faction: Mods
  on scan guest
    -> breaking_news
